help: /**
 * Returns `true` if some element at or after `fromIndex` equals `elem`. Equality dispatches through each element's `equals`.
 * @param elem The value to search for.
 * @param fromIndex Index to begin searching from. Negative counts from the end. Defaults to `0`.
 */
